<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Mining year net up 58.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Mining year net up 58.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Jan 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  43.66   vs	  27.57</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	  6.1    vs	   4.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,392.77   vs     1,268.34</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    91.91   vs	  68.01</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 10.95   vs  less  10.21</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	   61.32   vs	   6.47</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	  5.0    vs	   3.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the company is Malaysia Mining Corp Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
